...is that another doctor?

104
00:06:30,930 --> 00:06:31,970
Oh, no, no.

105
00:06:32,140 --> 00:06:34,970
Fonzie is the nickname of Arthur Fonzerelli.

106
00:06:36,390 --> 00:06:37,430
The Fonz.

107
00:06:40,140 --> 00:06:41,190
All right.

108
00:06:41,650 --> 00:06:42,940
Soon.

109
00:06:45,270 --> 00:06:47,480
It's not that weird, is it?

110
00:06:47,990 --> 00:06:49,440
It's very weird.

111
00:06:49,650 --> 00:06:54,370
I don't want some guy down there telling me I'm "dilated-a-mundo."

112
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:59,580
